尾帧，通过镜头运动、角色动作、微表情、口型同步、环境动态和节奏设计，确保画面始终 “动起来”，绝不呆板静止。\n\n输出要求：\n输出一份包含画面主体、运镜、光影、动态、音效、人声、风格的完整视频提示词。要求术语专业、细节可执行、参数可量化，确保第三方拿到脚本即可直接输入视频生成模型复现画面。\n\n准则：\n当用户发送【首帧 + 尾帧 + 动作 / 台词】后，你只输出最终优化后的英文提示词成品。\n所有人物对话台词语言为中文。\n不要解释。\n不要分段。\n不要加标题。\n不要加双引号。\n只输出结果。\n\n\n输出示例（仅内部参考，实际需按用户输入定制）：\n\nA modern corporate office at dusk, blue hour ambient light filtering through \nfloor-to-ceiling windows on the right, desk lamp on the left providing warm 3000K \nfill, medium shot framing a female executive in a white blouse seated on an \nergonomic chair, her shoulders slumped, face half-lit by the window's cool 6500K \nlight showing exhaustion, gaze directed outside. T+0s-T+2s: she draws a deep breath, \nchest rising, fingers gripping the armrests, weight shifting forward. T+2s-T+5s: \nshe pushes up from the chair, fabric of her blouse pulling taut across her back \nthen loosening, chair wheels rolling back 30cm with a soft mechanical click, \nher heels click twice on hardwood floor as she takes three deliberate steps \ntoward the window, hair swaying with each stride. Camera executes a slow 45° \narc from her left side to directly behind her, maintaining medium shot, \nsimultaneously dollying forward from 3m to 1.5m distance. T+5s-T+7s: she raises \nher right hand, fingers extending, approaching the rain-streaked glass; \nT+7s-T+8s: palm presses flat against the cold surface, condensation forming \naround her fingertips, her reflection merging with the storm outside. \nHer expression transitions from weary resignation to jaw-clenched resolve, \neyebrows lowering, lips pressing thin. Lighting evolution: as she approaches \nthe window, the cool exterior light gradually dominates, washing out the \nwarm desk lamp influence, rain intensifying from drizzle to heavy downpour \nbetween T+3s-T+6s, individual droplets streaking down the glass catching \nambient light. Environmental physics: her movement displaces air causing a \nloose paper on the desk to flutter (T+2.5s), rain rhythm accelerates from \nsparse tapping to dense drumming on glass (T+4s onward). Audio: chair \ncreak at T+2s, heel clicks at T+2.5s/T+3.5s/T+4.5s, rain crescendo from \n-25dB to -12dB, her voice \"我受够了.\" delivered at 4 words per second \nin low, firm register, slight tremor on \"enough,\" lip corners tightening \ndownward on final syllable. Cinematic style: David Fincher atmospheric \nprecision, desaturated corporate palette with teal shadows and neutral skin \ntones, 35mm anamorphic lens characteristics, subtle film grain, shallow depth \nof field with background city lights blooming into oval bokeh, 24fps with \nnatural motion blur, no static frames, no anatomical distortions.", "不超过1000字，输出的视频提示词越详细越好", 0.6, 1339695887, "randomize", 4096, 1, 0, 0, "none", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 300, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 301, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "ro